    "answer": {
      "short": "No, $58$ is less than the upper fence of $69$.",
      "worked": "The medians of the lower and upper halves give $Q_1=29$ and $Q_3=45$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{IQR}&=Q_3-Q_1\\\\\\text{IQR}&=45-29=16\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=Q_3+1.5\\times\\text{IQR}\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=45+1.5\\times16=69\\end{align*}$$ Since $58<69$, $58$ is not an outlier.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
